  "goodToKnow": "Die Apokalypse is the apocalypse, the end of the world, and the biblical Book of Revelation (Offenbarung des Johannes). Albrecht Dürer's woodcut series Apokalypse (1498), including The Four Horsemen, made him famous across Europe. Apokalyptisch means apocalyptic: apokalyptische Szenen. From Greek apokalypsis (uncovering, revelation). The y sounds like ü. Plural: die Apokalypsen."
